  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="codex">
        <pb n="1" facs="#f01" />
        <div n="1" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f01-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">○悞捉瘋疾　黑列埠友函云、七月四號在該埠教堂、有華人名和利先生者、請華英各</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f01-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">位食餐、預請帖三百、但各高慶來至五百、緣先生被皇家疑其瘋疾、悞捉入瘋院、後醫生</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f01-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">驗明放出、故思所以酬謝、是晚亞廣先生為主席、曰、今晚各貴駕賁臨、為賀和利先生事、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f01-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">茲先生前因腳症、請西婦調理、用藥水一樽、頗有見效、後未曾再求、至五月十二號、突然</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f01-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皇家差人捉入瘋院、另被布帳居住、雪冷霜嚴風飄雨漏、飲食幾絕、蛇鼠殊多、真令幾不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f01-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">欲生、但念罔極之恩、纖毫未報、屈指計之、已十八日、於茲矣、至六月一號、皇家人到看、令</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f01-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">入該埠大醫院、幸醫生與女工料理週全、六月廿號、全愈放出、見德重華嵩、愧無以謝、華</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f01-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人聞之、故特聯絡敬請、時</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f01-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">有華英字銀牌、送度打士</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f01-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">覓、度打勿當奴、度打拖、每</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f01-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">名壹個、各位感謝、此乃維</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f01-s-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">利先生善於佈置也、是時</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="13" xml:id="f01-s-c13">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">歌詩讚美、鼓掌交稱、乘興</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="14" xml:id="f01-s-c14">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而來、亦興盡而返矣、</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">1898年7月13日第5號第4版。自下方第1至7欄末華，接同版左上方第8欄首人聞之，至第14欄末返矣。中段左鄰是另一題神女報文，下方為英文刊記，均不計入。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:4">
              <quote>腳症</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">腳</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">脚</seg>
              <note type="editorial">兩稿所讀形近。右邊筆畫連結，留原讀並列異體。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:8">
              <quote>故特聯絡</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">特</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">持</seg>
              <note type="editorial">左旁短筆與豎連接，候特／持，未以規則改正文。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:11">
              <quote>名壹個</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">個</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">佃</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原印亻旁、右框內線相連。留初讀並附另一形。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="2" facs="#f02" />
        <div n="2" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f02-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">○貪色染瘋　坤士蘭省、庇厘時</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f02-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">賓埠、有一西人、年方三十三歲、自</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f02-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">交親至今、有兒女六名、家本貧乏、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f02-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">身操苦工、詎一旦染得瘋疾、被捉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f02-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">入醫院、而醫生驗之確然、奈何鍾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f02-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">情玉貌、不思李下避嫌、結想花容、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f02-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">竟作桑間訂好、風流也、而矣、</seg>
              <note type="source-note" n="12">
                <seg type="note-line" n="1">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">災禍</seg>
                </seg>
                <seg type="note-line" n="2">
                  <seg type="diplomatic-text">伏焉、</seg>
                </seg>
              </note>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">1898年8月10日第2版。原版七欄，題在第一欄內。第七欄而後有成對小欄，先右後左，接原欄大字矣。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:6">
              <quote>玉貌</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">玉貌</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">王貌</seg>
              <note type="editorial">右下小墨痕使玉較合原形，獨立稿另候王。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="3" facs="#f03" />
        <div n="3" type="scan" subtype="binding">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f03-s-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">○瘋者亦樂　當此隆冬</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f03-s-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">佳節、正人生行樂之時、或</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f03-s-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">豪飲高歌、或泛舟躋巘、無</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f03-s-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">論諸色人等、皆乘興而往、</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f03-s-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">興盡而歸、所異者瘋人亦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f03-s-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">有此興舉、久嗟餅□、縱釀</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f03-s-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">熟鄰翁、安敢行同吏部、欲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f03-s-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">枯腸之稍潤、俾俗慮之潛消、是非三五成羣、飄然一葉不可、接二十九</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f03-s-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">號洋報云、庇厘時𡁟埠、有西人發瘋者數名、昨禮拜一日大日子、以為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f03-s-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">佳節不可失、行樂須及時、遂向瘋院司事人、借艇仔一艘、以效子陵之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="11" xml:id="f03-s-c11">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">釣為名、乃學劉伶之飲為實、及棹出遠處、舟泊蘆邊、人登蓼岸、見夫二</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="12" xml:id="f03-s-c12">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">八當壚、不必借問何處、乃往酒樓沽酒、共圖大醉、酒家人見是瘋人、不</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="13" xml:id="f03-s-c13">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">禁為之驚駭焉、從此渴疾已消、流涎稍慰、向煙波而返棹、恍入桃源、覺</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="14" xml:id="f03-s-c14">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">酩酊之扶歸、知酣竹葉、在人不堪其憂、而在彼不改其樂、噫異矣、</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">1899年1月4日第2版。最下方第1至7欄，跨欲接左上方第8欄之枯腸，至第14欄末噫異矣。上段左另起紙難包火，下另題暹法傷和。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:6">
              <quote>久嗟餅□</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">罄</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">墊</seg>
              <note type="editorial">餅後字下部近土，兩讀不能定，候罄或墊。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:8">
              <quote>接二十九</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">接</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">按</seg>
              <note type="editorial">手旁右上印筆連合，另一讀作按，待更清楚原件。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="single:14">
              <quote>知酣竹葉</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">酣</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">斟</seg>
              <note type="editorial">左側酉框相近，右部短橫印墨接合。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
